      "writtenOn": "2020-02-27T15:13:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "in updateL2KeyAndGroupHint, setL2KeyAndGroupHint has been called to update the l2key and grouphint for ipmemeorystore (However, in IpClient#RunningState CMD_UPDATE_L2KEY_GROUPHINT is not implemented). This is the earliest place to notify IpClient roaming to the target network completed, we can update the bssid for DHCP roaming feature and also update mL2Key and mGroupHint member of IpClient with this new method.",
