      "writtenOn": "2020-02-27T18:41:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "setL2KeyAndGroupHint was called just a few lines above, in handleSupplicantStateChange.\nThe only difference is that the state change message has been sent since then, and I don\u0027t think that there were other interactions with ipClient.\n\nIs it a bug that in IpClient#RunningState CMD_UPDATE_L2KEY_GROUPHINT is not implemented?",
      "parentUuid": "68c54fc8_eb9ed4b7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4092,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 4095,
        "endChar": 77
      },
      "revId": "65218411cfd9d4ef6c1baa30d73e48fbbd10ea43",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
