    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4bdfe3f4_2b26dbe3",
        "filename": "service/java/com/android/server/wifi/ClientModeImpl.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 4095,
      "author": {
        "id": 1406251
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-28T09:34:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the concern depends on whether updateLayer2Information should take L2key and grouphint parameters or not.\n   - If updateLayer2Information() only take bssid as parameter, yes, we can add CMD_UPDATE_L2KEY_GROUPHINT in IpClient#RunningState and update the mL2key and mGroupHint. However, this requires that setL2KeyAndGroupHint() always binds with updateLayer2Information() as a pair calling. Sometimes caller might forget to call setL2KeyAndGroupHint() firstly, then l2key and grouphint won\u0027t be updated.\n\n   - If updateLayer2Information takes Layer2InformationParcelable as parameter, it already includes bssid, l2key and grouphint. We don\u0027t need to care about the calling order as mentioned above.\n\nThought?",
      "parentUuid": "cdba123e_b7805d5d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4092,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 4095,
        "endChar": 77
      },
      "revId": "65218411cfd9d4ef6c1baa30d73e48fbbd10ea43",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "eb839b23_e253d9b5",
