      "writtenOn": "2020-02-28T18:26:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we just always use updateLayer2Information instead of setL2KeyAndGroupHint? We must have the BSSID anyway in order to compute the L2 key.\n\noptional: use a MacAddress instead of a String in Layer2Information.",
      "parentUuid": "4bdfe3f4_2b26dbe3",
